      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/54/name"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:5f5e810d9f5791c9c9cdfdd4",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "所以，也请训练员相信我吧。\n我一定会证明你是一个很厉害的人──！",
      "source_fingerprint": "30256bfbc5b097bd16c46bf57a08db2587b23afe330d090bfdcd025ab1e6df29",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/04/1100/storytimeline_041100003.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        54,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/54/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:fa58c0cfea09ca90b4e1210b",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "看到她精神饱满，我点头表示赞同，但心里仍然很担心。\n奇锐骏虽然确实地进行着减重的训练项目──",
      "source_fingerprint": "e245caad059af33ab604c50e854a226bbcafaf7821f929dc9b3c7b98ea74b097",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/04/1100/storytimeline_041100003.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        6,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/6/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:58872144872a05cca1e6824e",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "但做得太过头了。因为她对自己过于严厉，\n体重比我原先预期的还要掉得更多……",
      "source_fingerprint": "4c12010bd3282d9264e3c1921496a4a8c877b445c4bcedc96e37de3eb4141805",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/04/1100/storytimeline_041100003.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        7,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/7/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:3c39e84b1c3f35a6302b0179",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "午餐时的食堂。虽然我设计了灵活的菜单，\n奇锐骏还是只吃了最低限度的量。",
      "source_fingerprint": "d89124cce85ff987804e0f221ee3a38ae101bc1eec68bad1eae6f872340ae137",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/04/1100/storytimeline_041100003.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        8,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/8/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e83922674a451255444a4c89",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "要是减到比适当体重还低，减重可能会造成反效果。\n正当我要去提醒她恢复原本的进食量时──",
      "source_fingerprint": "dbfe9651a24f831f7f98daf039d012c19c9006240e7129a0f3a40f3723d04e7b",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/04/1100/storytimeline_041100003.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        9,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/9/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:0a3b2a29d74511820a57a4fc",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "无法置之不理的东西",
      "source_fingerprint": "38bf60cd9674d7f18e1198a7fb210ced5e0091b0bedaef5b5a7762e360897f16",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/04/1100/storytimeline_041100003.json",
