    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:15010ecfda1cf8df8bde4218",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "哎呀，谢谢你帮我捶肩膀。再用力点也没关系喔。\n拿出全力捶我，让我鼓起干劲吧。",
      "source_fingerprint": "aa00211dea083d30d5143dcd14b7ccfa794e321cecc942df26807d9c5b262813",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/04/1100/storytimeline_041100004.json",
      "json_path": [
