    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:6460f79b0860c0ecbaee395f",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "看来轻轻敲打是无法让她放松身心的。\n那我就在每次敲打中，确实注入我的心意跟力道……！",
      "source_fingerprint": "931182c33a7ac4b51996314300e415aa8427df24d71e686a9f73db6a031c54d0",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
