    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a264b762f56a7ce7f952f354",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "今天的天气非常好，第十场比赛・沙土2000米。\n各位赛马娘都进入闸门了──现在，开始！",
      "source_fingerprint": "7b18b795aed21822ab0898662428fdec946f7e051cdd53f8d5ed3bc348afed1b",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
